  "text_content": "The big match between the two classes was about to begin. Dayo, the captain, tied his jersey and ran onto the field with his teammates. The referee blew his whistle, and the game began. Dayo dribbled past one defender, then past another. The goalkeeper gasped and spread his arms wide. Dayo could have kicked the ball himself, but he saw Tolu standing alone near the goal. He kicked it high, and the ball bounced off Tolu's head and into the net. The goalkeeper could not stop it. The crowd cheered and clapped with joy. The referee blew his whistle again, and the match was over. Dayo's team had won the trophy. The other team shook hands with Dayo and Tolu and smiled. Dayo lifted the trophy and said that the best part was the pass. A good captain gives his friends a chance to shine.",
